30:["$","div","32",{"className":"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-5 py-4 leading-[1.7] text-ink","children":"Save this one. Cursor builds, Hermes automates, Obsidian remembers, Perplexity researches, NotebookLM grounds. That's the whole loop from idea to finished work, and once you've got all five running you move faster than teams ten times your size."}]
